+      "remediation": "Reject uploads unless the request is bound to a valid checkout context and an enabled file field for that checkout. Do not fall back to the master allowlist when `field_key` or `checkout_id` is absent. For guest flows, bind the upload token to a server-side guest session or other request-specific state instead of relying on the default logged-out WordPress nonce."
